              "object": "block",
              "type": "list-item",
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Vinay Kovvuri was responsible for working on the ELA chip animation, while Aditi was tasked with providing documents and images related to the company's values, vision, and patents for the website",
                      "object": "text",
                      "marks": []
                    }
                  ],
                  "object": "block",
                  "type": "transcript",
                  "data": {
                    "uuid": "0d3a6b40-3c92-4f7d-9255-99ccf6f496b6",
