              "object": "block",
              "type": "list-item",
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Although no specific followup meeting was scheduled, action items were clearly assigned, and there was a consensus on the importance of appropriate website imagery to support the company's goal of standing out from competitors",
